      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The pain you feel from the sudden shift in how others see you is incredibly heavy, and it is a very natural reaction to feel abandoned after you've given so much. Please try to remember that \"success\" is a label, and people can see through that to the real, vulnerable person you are regardless of your bank account. You are not \"dead\" to them; your identity is so much more than the \"successful\" mask you had to wear for a decade. I hope you can allow yourself this quiet space to breathe and feel the grief without the pressure to explain or justify yourself to anyone just yet.",
